00:00:03.240 --> 00:00:05.460
<i>Magical Girl Nicolara!</i>

00:00:05.910 --> 00:00:08.800
Time for a flash sale!

00:00:09.740 --> 00:00:13.630
I'm gonna send your wrath soaring 
beyond the stars in the sky!

00:00:15.370 --> 00:00:17.640
Smile...

00:00:17.640 --> 00:00:19.290
Hurricane!

00:00:19.750 --> 00:00:21.220
Nico!

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:26.830
Sorry, but we're closed for today!

00:00:27.230 --> 00:00:28.060
Kya-ha!

00:00:28.620 --> 00:00:30.900
The current Sunday morning 
line-up is so hype.

00:00:30.900 --> 00:00:33.040
I was worried about them 
ditching the team-of-five formula,

00:00:33.040 --> 00:00:34.840
but focusing on one character 
isn't all that bad.

00:00:34.840 --> 00:00:36.780
Actually, no! It's great!

00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:42.460
Happiness Full Field!

00:00:50.560 --> 00:00:51.620
Kya-ha!

00:00:54.860 --> 00:00:55.980
Okay!

00:01:03.290 --> 00:01:05.920
Smile...

00:01:06.460 --> 00:01:09.430
Hurricane!

00:01:09.430 --> 00:01:10.310
Huh?

00:01:15.540 --> 00:01:17.570
Oh, no!

00:01:17.570 --> 00:01:18.300
You got me!

00:01:18.300 --> 00:01:20.990
Stop it! Leave me alone!

00:01:33.620 --> 00:01:34.700
<b>ONIMAI: I'm Now Your Sister</b>

00:01:35.200 --> 00:01:36.330
<b>ONIMAI: I'm Now Your Sister</b>

00:01:38.500 --> 00:01:41.630
<b>Mahiro Oyama</b>

00:01:44.800 --> 00:01:47.840
<b>Mihari Oyama</b>

00:02:42.650 --> 00:02:51.030
<b>ONIMAI: I'm Now Your Sister</b>

00:02:51.530 --> 00:02:56.490
<b>#04 Mahiro's New Friend</b>

00:02:54.940 --> 00:02:59.070
You've become a real little girl,
right down to your interests.

00:02:59.070 --> 00:03:01.720
The Sunday morning block is 
for all men of culture!

00:03:07.300 --> 00:03:09.580
I'm afraid I must take my leave.

00:03:11.110 --> 00:03:11.960
Huh?

00:03:13.390 --> 00:03:15.450
B-But whatever for, Mihari?!

00:03:15.450 --> 00:03:17.890
Have I disappointed you in some way?!

00:03:17.890 --> 00:03:19.760
Don't be silly.

00:03:20.330 --> 00:03:23.300
Anyway, it was just a formality.

00:03:23.300 --> 00:03:25.560
I'm at a major turning point in my research,

00:03:25.560 --> 00:03:28.770
so I'll most likely be staying 
over at school tonight.

00:03:28.770 --> 00:03:31.200
Do you think you can take care 
of things at home for me?

00:03:31.200 --> 00:03:33.670
B-But—

00:03:33.670 --> 00:03:35.500
Of course!

00:03:36.090 --> 00:03:38.450
I wouldn't have it any other way!

00:03:38.450 --> 00:03:41.540
You're talking to a pro home 
security officer, remember?!

00:03:42.120 --> 00:03:43.740
Oh, is that right?

00:03:47.170 --> 00:03:49.500
You'll have to make yourself 
dinner, all right?

00:03:50.780 --> 00:03:53.470
I-I'll just get something 
from the corner store...

00:03:56.030 --> 00:03:57.850
And don't forget the housework!

00:03:58.350 --> 00:04:00.510
That I cannot promise!

00:04:02.100 --> 00:04:04.090
Are you sure you'll be okay?

00:04:04.090 --> 00:04:07.130
I'll be fine! Quit worrying, will ya?

00:04:07.130 --> 00:04:08.950
I have a bad feeling...

00:04:08.950 --> 00:04:10.950
See you tomorrow!

00:04:10.950 --> 00:04:13.140
Yep, yep!

00:04:21.550 --> 00:04:23.960
Freedom!

00:04:23.960 --> 00:04:27.460
Time to loaf around to my heart's content!

00:04:32.380 --> 00:04:34.170
Maybe I should get changed first.

00:04:34.170 --> 00:04:36.080
<b>Shut-in</b>

00:04:36.080 --> 00:04:39.660
This brings back memories!

00:04:39.660 --> 00:04:41.270
So loose and baggy!

00:04:42.670 --> 00:04:44.560
Wait! What am I getting all excited about?

00:04:48.640 --> 00:04:51.480
I guess I could play a game or something.

00:04:53.690 --> 00:04:54.650
<b>GUTS</b>

00:05:02.230 --> 00:05:04.310
Not feeling it right now for some reason.

00:05:06.970 --> 00:05:09.390
Maybe I'll read manga instead.

00:05:21.800 --> 00:05:25.780
I just can't focus on any of it.

00:05:25.780 --> 00:05:28.410
Come to think of it, ever 
since I got this new body,

00:05:28.410 --> 00:05:31.240
Mihari's been there watching 
over me in some way or another.

