00:05:41.940 --> 00:05:45.990
We even hang out now and then.

00:05:45.990 --> 00:05:48.300
No, wait! Stop it!

00:05:48.300 --> 00:05:50.730
I'm making it sound like 
I'm lonely or something!

00:05:50.730 --> 00:05:52.330
That's it! I need food!

00:05:52.330 --> 00:05:54.130
And I'm gonna go all out!

00:05:55.520 --> 00:05:57.550
Whoa!

00:05:58.050 --> 00:06:00.580
It's a feast!

00:06:05.690 --> 00:06:08.670
A feasht fit for a king!

00:06:09.570 --> 00:06:11.930
And ish all foh me!

00:06:13.310 --> 00:06:15.550
Pizha shure ish nicsh 
every oncsh in a while!

00:06:15.550 --> 00:06:17.990
The oiler the becher!

00:06:19.310 --> 00:06:22.750
Wai— Water— Mihari—!

00:06:43.540 --> 00:06:46.220
I think I'm full.

00:06:47.770 --> 00:06:51.590
Guess I'll go take a bath and head to bed.

00:06:59.410 --> 00:07:01.220
I'm home!

00:07:02.930 --> 00:07:04.310
Onii-chan?!

00:07:09.290 --> 00:07:10.730
You awake?

00:07:15.960 --> 00:07:18.170
You went to bed without drying 
your hair, didn't you?

00:07:19.030 --> 00:07:22.420
Honestly. I knew you'd 
be hopeless without me.

00:07:29.080 --> 00:07:31.300
There! That's much bette—

00:07:31.870 --> 00:07:34.610
Wh-What's wrong? What happened?

00:07:35.290 --> 00:07:37.320
N-Nothing!

00:07:39.420 --> 00:07:40.480
Dummy.

00:07:44.260 --> 00:07:45.660
<i>Onimai.</i>

00:07:44.280 --> 00:07:44.360
<b>ONIMAI</b>

00:07:44.360 --> 00:07:44.450
<b>ONIMAI</b>

00:07:44.450 --> 00:07:44.530
<b>ONIMAI</b>

00:07:44.530 --> 00:07:44.910
<b>ONIMAI</b>

00:07:44.910 --> 00:07:46.030
<b>ONIMAI</b>

00:07:48.200 --> 00:07:50.040
<b>ONIMAI</b>

00:07:48.340 --> 00:07:49.520
<i>Onimai.</i>

00:07:59.750 --> 00:08:02.930
Mihari! Slow down!

00:08:04.310 --> 00:08:08.710
Oh, Onii-chan... So this 
is your weak spot, huh?

00:08:11.790 --> 00:08:15.050
Stop! I'm near the edge!

00:08:15.620 --> 00:08:18.800
I'm almost there!

00:08:21.290 --> 00:08:23.970
Yay! I win!

00:08:23.970 --> 00:08:25.350
And I'm out.

00:08:26.670 --> 00:08:29.000
Go pick up the groceries 
like we promised, okay?

00:08:29.000 --> 00:08:30.970
It's the supermarket across 
from the station.

00:08:30.970 --> 00:08:33.030
I wrote a list of everything we need.

00:08:33.970 --> 00:08:35.840
Grrr...

00:08:36.710 --> 00:08:37.700
Hmph!

00:08:37.700 --> 00:08:40.050
You can buy yourself a treat 
with the change, if you'd like.

00:08:40.050 --> 00:08:41.640
I'm <i>not</i> a child!

00:08:41.640 --> 00:08:43.080
Fine, I'll do it.

00:08:43.080 --> 00:08:45.430
I'm a man of my word, after all.

00:08:47.400 --> 00:08:50.210
I-I'll be right back...

00:08:50.610 --> 00:08:52.330
You got this!

00:09:06.500 --> 00:09:09.900
<i>Looks like he's slowly 
getting used to going out.</i>

00:09:10.660 --> 00:09:12.890
<i>He's even started helping 
around the house more,</i>

00:09:12.890 --> 00:09:14.830
<i>ever since he helped me through that cold.</i>

00:09:16.190 --> 00:09:19.070
He might be able to go 
back to a normal life soon.

00:09:19.070 --> 00:09:22.500
And then one day, he'll 
meet a great guy and...

00:09:24.710 --> 00:09:25.910
Oh, darling...

00:09:26.510 --> 00:09:28.200
I'm so happy.

00:09:31.050 --> 00:09:32.260
Okay, not likely.

00:09:32.260 --> 00:09:33.740
But one can dream.

00:09:35.480 --> 00:09:38.170
<b>LIKE</b>

00:09:37.300 --> 00:09:39.900
<b>LIKE</b>

00:09:42.240 --> 00:09:44.860
Mommy, I want hamburger steak for dinner!

00:09:44.860 --> 00:09:46.820
You have to ask nicely, dear.

00:09:46.820 --> 00:09:49.140
I can't do this!

00:09:49.140 --> 00:09:50.940
The corner store was bad enough!

00:09:50.940 --> 00:09:52.740
There are way too many people here!

00:09:53.180 --> 00:09:56.560
N-No! I can't just cower here like a child!

00:09:56.560 --> 00:10:01.340
I proved I could be a capable big 
brother when Mihari was ill, didn't I?!

00:10:02.750 --> 00:10:04.050
Excuse me...

00:10:05.080 --> 00:10:05.920
Y—

00:10:06.330 --> 00:10:07.380
Yes?!

00:10:12.260 --> 00:10:15.240
E-E-E-Err...

00:10:14.300 --> 00:10:16.780
Are you okay? Do you feel sick?

00:10:16.780 --> 00:10:17.470
Huh?

00:10:24.110 --> 00:10:25.950
You don't seem to have a fever.

00:10:25.950 --> 00:10:27.150
Um...

00:10:27.150 --> 00:10:29.530
If you need help, I'd be 
happy to lend a hand.

00:10:37.860 --> 00:10:40.110
Sorry about this.

00:10:40.110 --> 00:10:43.460
Don't be silly! It's my pleasure.

00:10:44.130 --> 00:10:47.470
I can't believe I dragged 
this poor boy into this.

00:10:47.470 --> 00:10:50.070
I'm not huge on big crowds myself.

00:10:50.070 --> 00:10:51.990
So what did you need to get?

00:10:51.990 --> 00:10:54.060
U-Uh, I have a list...

