00:11:23.030 --> 00:11:27.130
For carrots, I heard the deeper the 
color and smaller the stem, the better.

00:11:28.110 --> 00:11:29.670
You're so knowledgeable!

00:11:29.670 --> 00:11:31.010
You think so?

00:11:35.280 --> 00:11:38.670
<i>Ahh... What a nice guy.</i>

00:11:38.000 --> 00:11:40.230
Look, aren't those two cute?

00:11:40.720 --> 00:11:42.890
I wonder if they're a couple.

00:11:42.890 --> 00:11:44.910
Stop talking about strangers like that.

00:11:44.910 --> 00:11:47.200
A-A couple?!

00:11:48.150 --> 00:11:52.320
O-Oh, right. I'm a girl right now.

00:11:52.320 --> 00:11:54.980
No, but still! You can't just—

00:11:56.110 --> 00:11:57.320
Is something wrong?

00:11:59.250 --> 00:12:01.200
Uh... Wait a sec.

00:12:01.200 --> 00:12:03.650
Why am I so flustered?

00:12:05.090 --> 00:12:06.550
Are you feeling okay?

00:12:06.550 --> 00:12:08.490
I-It's not like that!

00:12:08.490 --> 00:12:11.910
There's been a big mistake here!

00:12:13.010 --> 00:12:14.870
Have a nice day!

00:12:16.880 --> 00:12:19.720
My body had a mind of its 
own for a second there.

00:12:20.800 --> 00:12:22.690
I'm glad you were able to get everything!

00:12:22.690 --> 00:12:25.050
Y-Yeah! Thanks!

00:12:25.430 --> 00:12:30.000
W-Well, Imma head— I-I'll 
be heading home now...

00:12:32.360 --> 00:12:34.350
Sorry, gimme one sec.

00:12:34.350 --> 00:12:35.080
Hello?

00:12:35.470 --> 00:12:38.010
I'm in front of the 
supermarket with a friend.

00:12:38.010 --> 00:12:39.500
Friend...

00:12:40.500 --> 00:12:42.540
Oh! There you are!

00:12:43.330 --> 00:12:44.770
Momiji!

00:12:46.330 --> 00:12:47.990
Kaede-chan?!

00:12:46.330 --> 00:12:47.990
Onee-chan!

00:12:48.790 --> 00:12:51.450
Wait, you're friends with Mahiro-chan?

00:12:51.450 --> 00:12:53.280
Where did you guys meet?

00:12:53.840 --> 00:12:55.710
"Onee-chan"?!

00:12:55.990 --> 00:12:59.990
<i>Come to think of it, she did say she 
had a little sister, didn't she?</i>

00:13:02.010 --> 00:13:03.860
"Little sister"?

00:13:03.860 --> 00:13:05.600
You're a girl?!

00:13:06.350 --> 00:13:09.990
You didn't know? Do I 
really look that boyish?

00:13:11.810 --> 00:13:14.450
You could at least put on a skirt.

00:13:14.450 --> 00:13:16.570
But I'm more comfortable in pants!

00:13:16.570 --> 00:13:17.720
Aww...

00:13:17.620 --> 00:13:20.760
<i>Thank goodness... She's a girl.</i>

00:13:17.720 --> 00:13:19.380
Give it a rest, okay?

00:13:19.380 --> 00:13:21.640
You're so sheepish sometimes.

00:13:21.250 --> 00:13:23.090
That was a close one.

00:13:29.410 --> 00:13:31.090
Oh!

00:13:31.090 --> 00:13:32.540
You mean Momiji-chan?

00:13:32.540 --> 00:13:34.050
She'd be in middle school now, I think.

00:13:34.050 --> 00:13:35.850
She's a good kid, isn't she?

00:13:35.850 --> 00:13:36.750
Yeah...

00:13:36.750 --> 00:13:39.020
She had me questioning 
myself for a minute there.

00:13:43.060 --> 00:13:45.280
Y-You're into little girls?!

00:13:45.280 --> 00:13:48.310
No, that's not what I meant!

00:13:48.310 --> 00:13:51.830
Besides, I'm technically the 
same age as her now, aren't I?

00:13:51.830 --> 00:13:54.690
Wait... Does that make me a lesbian?

00:13:57.820 --> 00:13:59.870
<b>ONIMAI</b>

00:13:58.140 --> 00:13:59.270
<i>Onimai.</i>

00:13:59.870 --> 00:14:03.290
Oyama

00:14:00.250 --> 00:14:01.750
Come in, come in!

00:14:01.750 --> 00:14:03.280
Thanks for having us!

00:14:05.690 --> 00:14:06.720
Sorry about this.

00:14:07.230 --> 00:14:09.170
I know you must be busy.

00:14:09.170 --> 00:14:11.000
Nonsense, it's fine!

00:14:13.700 --> 00:14:16.040
Wait a sec! Hey, Kaede-chan!

00:14:16.040 --> 00:14:17.810
Oh! Hi, Mahiro-chan!

00:14:17.810 --> 00:14:19.430
Sorry to bother you guys.

00:14:19.430 --> 00:14:20.900
And this is...?

00:14:22.410 --> 00:14:25.160
Hello! Nice to see you again!

00:14:26.140 --> 00:14:27.070
Who?

00:14:27.910 --> 00:14:29.780
I-It's Momiji!

00:14:29.780 --> 00:14:31.720
We met the other day, remember?!

00:14:33.100 --> 00:14:34.850
S-Sorry, it's just...

00:14:34.850 --> 00:14:38.630
You're wearing a skirt today, so 
I didn't recognize you, you know?

00:14:39.250 --> 00:14:41.370
It's my school uniform.

00:14:41.370 --> 00:14:43.260
We came straight here from school.

00:14:44.440 --> 00:14:46.280
Sorry we didn't tell you.

00:14:46.280 --> 00:14:48.800
She just insisted on tagging along.

00:14:48.800 --> 00:14:51.150
Why not? May as well if you are!

00:14:51.150 --> 00:14:54.600
I'm here to study for a test, you know?

00:14:57.290 --> 00:14:58.630
Honestly.

00:14:58.630 --> 00:15:00.450
You're hopeless.

00:15:02.150 --> 00:15:04.390
Sorry, Mahiro-chan.

00:15:04.390 --> 00:15:07.680
Do you mind playing with 
Momiji up in your room?

00:15:08.270 --> 00:15:11.260
Wha? M-My room?

00:15:11.260 --> 00:15:13.230
Just gimme one sec!

00:15:27.910 --> 00:15:29.370
Mahiro

00:15:29.010 --> 00:15:30.830
C-Come in...

00:15:30.830 --> 00:15:32.580
Thank you!

00:15:33.530 --> 00:15:35.080
Wow!

00:15:36.000 --> 00:15:39.410
Being alone in my room with a girl 
was not on today's agenda!

00:15:39.410 --> 00:15:42.050
What do you even do in this situation?!

00:15:42.050 --> 00:15:44.850
Your room's more boyish than 
I thought it was gonna be.

00:15:44.850 --> 00:15:46.670
You have so many game consoles!

00:15:46.670 --> 00:15:48.420
Y-You think so?

00:15:48.420 --> 00:15:50.900
<i>I can't let her look around too much!</i>

00:15:50.900 --> 00:15:53.650
<i>J-Just pick a topic! Anything!</i>

00:15:56.420 --> 00:15:58.340
By the way, Mahiro-chan.

00:15:58.340 --> 00:15:59.330
What's thi—?

00:15:59.330 --> 00:16:01.090
Oh! That's right!

00:16:01.090 --> 00:16:03.270
Do you hate skirts, Momiji?

00:16:03.270 --> 00:16:03.870
Huh?

00:16:03.870 --> 00:16:07.480
U-Um... I wouldn't go that far.

00:16:07.480 --> 00:16:10.730
But skirts feel so drafty, right?

00:16:10.730 --> 00:16:12.890
It feels a little pointless.

00:16:13.460 --> 00:16:16.620
I-I-I feel that!

00:16:17.000 --> 00:16:19.930
They don't really suit me anyway.

00:16:19.930 --> 00:16:21.430
What? That's not true!

00:16:21.430 --> 00:16:23.860
You look pretty cute to me.

00:16:23.860 --> 00:16:25.650
C-Cu...

00:16:27.540 --> 00:16:31.740
N-No way! You look ten 
times cuter than I do!

00:16:31.740 --> 00:16:33.670
Wait, wha...?!

00:16:36.120 --> 00:16:37.850
No, no, no! No way!

00:16:37.850 --> 00:16:40.750
Well, actually, I do look pretty cute...

00:16:40.750 --> 00:16:42.080
But we're not talking about me!

00:16:44.210 --> 00:16:48.140
So you admit it, huh?

00:16:53.910 --> 00:16:55.940
Time for punishment!

00:16:56.580 --> 00:16:57.740
Stop, stop, stop!

00:16:57.740 --> 00:16:59.260
Stop it!

00:16:59.260 --> 00:17:00.850
Take this, and that!

00:16:59.260 --> 00:17:01.320
<i>Wait, what? Huh?</i>

00:17:01.320 --> 00:17:02.860
<i>What's happening?</i>

00:17:02.860 --> 00:17:04.750
I'm not done yet!

00:17:02.860 --> 00:17:06.170
<i>Is this how girls interact with each other?</i>

00:17:06.520 --> 00:17:08.480
Tickle, tickle, tickle!

00:17:07.330 --> 00:17:09.390
N-No more!

00:17:19.650 --> 00:17:22.010
I'm sorry! I took it too far!

00:17:26.880 --> 00:17:28.390
A-Anyway...

00:17:28.390 --> 00:17:31.440
I'm sure if you give it some time, 
you'll get used to them.

00:17:31.440 --> 00:17:34.370
Plus, you might feel better if 
you wore tights underneath.

00:17:34.370 --> 00:17:36.740
G-Got it.

00:17:36.740 --> 00:17:39.670
I'm so sorry about your manga, Mahiro-chan!

00:17:39.670 --> 00:17:41.960
They're all over the floor...

00:17:42.300 --> 00:17:44.380
<b>Milkpie</b>

00:17:44.380 --> 00:17:46.510
I-I-I-I-Is this—?

00:17:47.190 --> 00:17:49.040
Don't look at that!

00:17:53.700 --> 00:17:54.970
Mahiro-chan?

00:17:55.700 --> 00:17:58.760
Um... Is that...

00:17:58.760 --> 00:18:02.640
I-Is that a... dirty...

00:18:02.640 --> 00:18:06.780
This is... Um, you know?

00:18:07.530 --> 00:18:09.940
This is my brother's!

00:18:09.940 --> 00:18:11.700
Your brother's?

00:18:11.700 --> 00:18:12.580
Uh...

00:18:12.980 --> 00:18:16.650
Y-Yeah. Um... Err...

00:18:18.540 --> 00:18:21.130
This used to be my big 
brother's room, you see?

00:18:21.130 --> 00:18:25.050
I-I'm just... using it for the time being.

00:18:25.570 --> 00:18:28.840
Oh! He got into a good college,

00:18:28.840 --> 00:18:31.850
so he's living on his 
own far away from home.

00:18:33.520 --> 00:18:36.630
So your brother's into 
that kind of stuff, huh?

00:18:44.790 --> 00:18:47.850
I-I couldn't just throw out all his stuff.

00:18:47.850 --> 00:18:50.800
So I just kept everything 
the way he left it.

00:18:50.800 --> 00:18:52.250
I know it's weird, but...

00:18:53.170 --> 00:18:56.720
They remind me of him...

00:18:56.720 --> 00:18:58.490
I see...

00:18:58.490 --> 00:19:00.100
That makes sense.

00:19:00.550 --> 00:19:01.710
But still...

00:19:03.130 --> 00:19:05.700
You really shouldn't have 
these lying around!

00:19:06.680 --> 00:19:07.610
Wha?

00:19:07.610 --> 00:19:09.820
Let's at least put the 
dirty ones away somewhere!

00:19:09.820 --> 00:19:11.240
I'll help!

00:19:11.240 --> 00:19:11.960
Wha?

00:19:12.310 --> 00:19:13.100
What?!

00:19:13.100 --> 00:19:14.390
Uh... Hold on...

00:19:14.390 --> 00:19:16.350
Look, there's a box right over there.

00:19:17.730 --> 00:19:22.650
Making This 
Sassy Babe Mine

00:19:22.650 --> 00:19:23.810
Raising My Own Elves

00:19:22.650 --> 00:19:23.940
A Peach-Colored Life

00:19:23.360 --> 00:19:24.610
The Sexy Fox Spirit

00:19:24.610 --> 00:19:28.060
Super Sexy Cooking

00:19:25.610 --> 00:19:27.030
Tightly Bound

00:19:26.230 --> 00:19:28.070
<b>Complex 3P</b>

00:19:28.060 --> 00:19:31.440
Um... Could we at least 
sort them by genre?

00:19:39.940 --> 00:19:41.780
That should do it.

00:19:41.780 --> 00:19:44.340
Farewell, my comrades...

00:19:44.860 --> 00:19:47.100
Though I guess we're not throwing them out,

00:19:47.100 --> 00:19:48.880
so it's not the end of the world.

00:19:48.880 --> 00:19:52.020
Now to put this in the closet.

00:19:54.610 --> 00:19:56.700
Be careful, it's heavy!

00:19:56.700 --> 00:19:57.680
I got it!

00:19:58.170 --> 00:19:59.300
I'll help you!

00:20:08.650 --> 00:20:10.470
Ow, ow, ouch...

00:20:10.470 --> 00:20:12.670
Sorry! Are you all right?

00:20:23.920 --> 00:20:24.970
What happened?!

00:20:24.970 --> 00:20:26.850
I heard a really big thud just now!

00:20:31.890 --> 00:20:33.220
Um...

00:20:35.260 --> 00:20:38.840
I-I swear, Mihari— Onee-chan!

00:20:38.840 --> 00:20:40.220
It's not what it looks like!

00:20:41.330 --> 00:20:44.990
Mahiro-chan, shouldn't she be 
the one saying that, not you?

00:20:47.780 --> 00:20:50.270
Already acting like besties, huh?

00:20:52.760 --> 00:20:55.170
I'm so glad she catches on quick.

00:20:56.740 --> 00:20:58.350
Thanks for today!

00:20:58.900 --> 00:21:00.680
I'm much more confident 
about the test now!

00:21:00.680 --> 00:21:02.310
Good luck!

00:21:03.580 --> 00:21:05.630
See you later, Mahiro-chan!

00:21:06.990 --> 00:21:09.140
Y-Yeah!

00:21:14.470 --> 00:21:16.940
Look at you, making friends!

00:21:16.940 --> 00:21:19.740
Me making friends with a girl 
her age is basically a crime!

00:21:19.740 --> 00:21:21.700
But you're around the same age as her now.

00:21:21.700 --> 00:21:23.500
Hmm, I guess.

00:21:23.500 --> 00:21:25.540
More importantly...

00:21:25.540 --> 00:21:26.270
Hmm?

00:21:26.270 --> 00:21:29.350
She touched my boobs.

00:21:31.180 --> 00:21:33.990
So, what did you guys do together?

00:21:33.990 --> 00:21:36.250
Wha? Oh! Uh...

00:21:36.250 --> 00:21:37.230
It's a secret!

00:21:40.690 --> 00:21:43.320
She seems cool, though, doesn't she?

00:23:26.260 --> 00:23:28.010
They were so soft and squishy...

00:23:32.940 --> 00:23:34.340
Still rock-solid!

00:23:35.020 --> 00:23:40.020
<b>See you next week!!</b>

